 href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Cube\">Ice Cube</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shard\">Shard</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Rapier\">Ice Rapier</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer\">Dragon Slayer</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["frost-dragon-quest","the-dream-courts-quest","the-explorer-society-quest","the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest"]}